		(property "Description" "CS1238 24-bit dual-channel ADC module (purple breakout with TL431 2.5V reference). 6-pin analog header (pins 1-6: E+, E-, A+, A-, B+, B-) and 4-pin digital header (pins 7-10: GND, DT, SCK, VCC). VCC 3.0-5.5V. DT is bidirectional DRDY/DOUT/config data; SCK is a plain 2-wire clock, not I2C. Always follow the board silkscreen for pin order."
